
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Pet Shop</title>
</head>

<body>

    <header id="home">
        <h1> Pet Shop</h1>

        <nav>
            <a href="#home">Home</a> |
            <a href="#pets">Our Pets</a> |
            <a href="#videos">Pet Videos</a> |
            <a href="#contact">Contact Us</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <hr>
    <section>
        <h2>Welcome to Pet shop!</h2>

        <p>
            Welcome to  Pet Shop.
            We love animals and want every pet
            to find a happy and caring home.
        </p>

        <p>
            Explore our website to see cute pets and
            caring friends.
        </p>
    </section>

    <hr>

    <section id="pets">
        <h2>Meet Our Pets</h2>

        <p>Here are some lovely animals!</p>

        <h3>Dogs</h3>
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552053831-71594a27632d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
             alt="A cute dog" width="300">

    <hr>

    <section id="videos">
        <h2>Pet Videos</h2>

        <p>Watch this funny video!</p>

        <iframe
            width="560"
            height="315"
            src="https://www.bing.com/videos/riverview/relatedvideo?q=dog+video&mid=E01D45FD58DDBFAD3B69E01D45FD58DDBFAD3B69&churl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube.com%2fchannel%2fUCvveQAkC2cwDn5TuKWuSkCw&FORM=VIRE"
        title="Animal video"
            title="Sample video"
            allowfullscreen>
        </iframe>
    </section>

    <hr>
    <section id="contact">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>

        <p>Have questions? Please contact us!</p>

        <form action="#" method="post">

            <label for="name">Full Name:</label><br>
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name"
                   placeholder="Enter your name" required>
            <br><br>

            <label for="email">Email Address:</label><br>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email"
                   placeholder="Enter your email" required>
            <br><br>

            <label for="message">Your Message:</label><br>
            <textarea id="message" name="message"
                      rows="5" cols="40"
                      placeholder="Write your message"
                      required></textarea>
            <br><br>

            <input type="submit" value="Send Message">

        </form>
    </section>
    <hr>
    <footer>
        <h3> Pet Shop</h3>

        <p>We care for pets and help them find loving homes.</p>

        <p>Email: petshopwebsite@pet.com</p>

        <a href="#home">Back to Top</a>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>


